            "displayName": "Stefan Guggisberg",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "> In revision 1005019 I restored the essential functionality of SessionImpl.dump() in the SessionContext.toString() method.\n\nthanks!",
          "updateAuthor": {
